 "notes": [
  "Exhibit 1 'Expenses' (2,220) excludes equity in income (7); segment exhibit 'Total expenses' (2,213) nets equity in income. Gain on dispositions is '—' in Q3-25 (3 in the nine months).",
  "Exhibit 1 prints 'Other income, net' = (2), i.e. income -> oth_inc = 2.",
  "Exhibit 5 adjusted net income prints only an aggregate 'Non-GAAP adjustments' line (52 after tax, $0.17/share). Footnote items after tax sum to 53 (computed); difference is company rounding. Pre-tax: operating 71, interest -6 (premium amortization benefit); tax on non-GAAP adjustments 13.",
  "Market Intelligence footnote (a) three-month items sum to 18 pre-tax (computed) vs Non-GAAP adjustments of 17 printed; corporate footnote (f) sums to 39 (computed) vs 40 printed. Company rounding; published numbers kept.",
  "Mobility three-month Non-GAAP adjustments print '—': severance 6, Executive Leadership Team transition benefit (4), legal settlement recovery (3) and acquisition-related costs 1 net to zero (footnote wording 'three and nine months' applies to all four).",
  "Footnote (d) after-tax for the corporate disposition-related costs is printed as $4 million ($6 million after-tax); kept as published.",
  "Deal-related amortization pre-tax printed 280; components segments 266 + corporate 1 + equity-method (OSTTRA) 14 = 281 (computed); company rounding. Tax 66; after tax 213.",
  "Tax item (h): tax benefit of $1 million due to annualized effective tax rate differences for GAAP, recorded as net -1 (removing a GAAP benefit).",
  "Balance sheet shows assets held for sale 200 and liabilities held for sale 45 (OSTTRA stake).",
  "seg_other.eq_deal_amort (extra key) = deal-related amortization within equity in income of unconsolidated subsidiaries.",
  "Cash flow is nine months year to date; three-month FCF from Exhibit 7 recorded with _q suffix. Capex and NCI distributions recorded as positive costs.",
  "Exhibit 5 also prints GAAP 'Effective tax rate' 20.8% (three months).",
  "Exhibit 8 GAAP-to-adjusted EPS guidance reconciliation: deal-related amortization 2.72, gain on sale of OSTTRA (0.59), premium amortization benefit (0.06), tax rate and other 0.73."
 ],
